OL,3,AUS announces new tariff proposals on
OL,4,AEU, China, and other trade partners
OL,5,
OL,6,FBut our business reporter says the
OL,7,Factual rates paid will be far lower due
OL,8,Fto trade deals Donald Trump has struck
OL,9,Fwith many countries
OL,11,FThe EU, for example, says the tariff on
OL,12,FEuropean goods entering the US will
OL,13,Fremain at a previously agreed 15%
OL,15,FThese latest proposals come after the
OL,16,FSupreme Court struck down Trump's
OL,17,F'Liberation Day' tariffs. The US claims
OL,18,Fthe targeted trading partners have
OL,19,F"excess capacity and production"
